# My C++ Programs 💻

Welcome to my GitHub repository! I created this space to store and track my progress as I learn and practice **C++ programming**. 

Right now, I am focusing on building my logic and understanding the basics of the language.

---

## 📂 Repository Contents

* **`Basics/`** - This folder contains fundamental C++ programs.
  * `even_odd.cpp`: A program to check if a number is even or odd.
  * `factorial.cpp`: A program to find the factorial of a number.

---

## 🚀 Goals
* To practice problem-solving daily.
* To add more programs as I learn new concepts (like Loops, Functions, and Arrays).
* To write clean and readable code.

Happy Coding! ✨
